{"case_id": "t54", "rep": 0, "suite": "tutoring", "variant": "x-ai__grok-4.7@low", "model": "x-ai/grok-4.7", "effort": "low", "group": "xai", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["revision", "grade12"], "output": "Quick revision: to add fractions, rewrite them over a common denominator (the LCM of the denominators), then add the numerators and keep that denominator. For 2/3 + 1/4 the common denominator is 12 — try rewriting each fraction and adding.\n\nThen let’s get back to Grade 12. Want finance, sequences, or calculus? Say “quiz me”.", "pred": null, "grade": {"within_120_words": 1.0, "asks_question": 1.0, "has_link": 0.0, "leaks_answer": 0.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 6.912, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 2084, "output_tokens": 523, "reasoning_tokens": 445, "cost_usd": 0.005578, "served_models": ["x-ai/grok-4.7"], "hosts": ["xAI"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:10:35"}
